    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Descent Into Darkness&quot;</strong>, you must take an elevator down into the depths of a mysterious underground complex, filled with dangers and secrets. Your goal is to find a way out\u2014but with each level, the darkness grows, and the threats become more terrifying...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Endless Descent \u2013 Explore procedurally generated levels, unlock new zones, and search for an escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Singleplayer &amp; Online Co-op \u2013 Survive alone or descend with friends (if you dare).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Dark Atmosphere \u2013 Eerie visuals and immersive sound design pull you into the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 First-Person &amp; Third-Person \u2013 Switch perspectives for the ultimate immersive horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Unspeakable Horrors \u2013 What watches you from the darkness? Don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the abyss?</p>",
